NOTE ON SCOPE AND USE

This software produces a screening report over a listed subset of WCAG 2.2
success criteria. It makes no conformance claim and must not be used as the
basis for one. Its language analysis is an unvalidated adaptation of PEMAT-P
(AHRQ) and the CDC Clear Communication Index, both of which were designed for
trained human raters assessing complete materials; output is labelled
"PEMAT-informed" and "CCI-informed" and is not an official or validated
application of either instrument. Neither AHRQ nor CDC endorses this tool.

The accuracy of its AI-assisted findings is unmeasured. Safety-relevant
content is routed to a human reviewer by design, and that routing must not be
removed. See readme.md, "What it is not".
